.TH CYAML_TYPE_STR 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cyaml_type_str \- return a string name for a node's type
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cyaml.h>

const char *cyaml_type_str(cyaml node);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Return a static string literal naming the type of node, e.g.
"CYAML_INTEGER".  Returns "CYAML_UNKNOWN" for unexpected type values.
Useful for diagnostics and test output.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Static null-terminated string; caller must not free it.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cyaml_type (3)
